WEBVTT

00:00:01.870 --> 00:00:05.130
What?! Junius Seven is moving?

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:06.660
But how?!

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:08.970
I have no idea.

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.660
Only that it is in fact moving, and fast.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.640
It is taking the worst possible trajectory.

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:18.320
It's impossible to change its orbit.

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:22.150
If we want to avoid a collision, we have no choice but to smash it to pieces.

00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:23.330
But that thing's huge.

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:28.580
The Voltaire and the Rousseau have taken the Meteor Breakers and gone ahead.

00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:30.330
Right. We should hurry as well.

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:33.010
That guy's flying out as well, I'm told.

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:36.440
They say for support work like this, the more machines we can get out, the better.

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:40.640
Really. Well, he is a mobile suit pilot, after all.

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:42.100
What's going on?!

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:43.080
<i>I have no idea</i>.

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:47.700
<i>What remains unchanged is that our mission is to support the Joule Team!</i>

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:50.660
<i>Upon completing equipment switch, please proceed for take off!</i>

00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:54.650
<i>The situation has changed</i>. <i>It could be dangerous</i>.

00:00:56.560 --> 00:00:57.740
<i>Would you rather not go?</i>

00:00:58.770 --> 00:00:59.990
Give me a little respect!

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:06.960
Athrun Zala, taking off!

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:21.840
I won't let you pests...

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:29.360
No one will get in our way! Not now!

00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:31.570
Commander!

00:01:33.370 --> 00:01:36.530
Retreat! We need to retreat for now!

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:41.250
I'm sending out rifles for your GuAIZes!

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:43.970
Dearka, protect those Meteor Breakers!

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:45.540
{split}I'll be right there!

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:26.910
So they're using GINNs?

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:29.540
Yes. They appear to be using High Maneuver Type 2s.

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:31.310
Any sign of a mothership?

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:32.590
None.

00:02:33.110 --> 00:02:34.750
But what the hell?

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:39.430
Does this mean these guys are responsible for altering Junius Seven's orbit?

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:42.260
Who in their right mind would do that?!

00:02:45.530 --> 00:02:50.520
But if that's true, it's all the more reason why we can't let them drop it on Earth!

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:52.880
Please keep Rey and the others updated!

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:53.450
Yes, ma'am!

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:54.820
Princess.

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:59.580
R-Right. Where's Athrun?

00:03:00.040 --> 00:03:02.810
What? You don't know?

00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:03.930
Huh?

00:03:04.570 --> 00:03:07.700
He came to us and asked that he be allowed to help.

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:10.710
He's out there right now.

